			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Format Canonicalize call in ParseWorkspaceFile\n\nApply consistent line formatting to the `Canonicalize::Fn` invocation within the `ParseWorkspaceFile` iterator in `Source/Workspace/WorkspaceFileService/ParseWorkspaceFile.rs`. The error mapping closure was previously split across lines inconsistently; this change aligns the method chain and closure placement with the project's Rust formatting standards.\n\nThis maintains readability in the workspace parsing logic while adhering to the strict code style enforced across the Mountain crate.",
